  "description": "All it took was a single elevator ride for the prey to be noticed by the predator. Gu Hana, a 27-year-old intern in the prestigious park group, knows that this is her last chance to make it into a big company. One day, she comes across a mysterious woman during an elevator ride. At first, she does not think much of it, but when fate keeps bringing them together again and again, Gu Hana starts to admire the woman. Unbeknownst to her, the woman is the chairwoman of her company.\n\n_Source: WEBTOON Canvas_",
